@country: Germany
@bio:

Mag. art. Olja Janjuš is a music theorist and data
steward. She is pursuing a PhD in Digital Musicology at the
University of Munich (LMU) under the supervision of Prof.
Dr. phil. Irene Holzer and works for two international
projects focusing on lute music research: E-LAUTE:
Electronic Linked Annotated Unified Tablature Edition
(https://www.e-laute.info/) and DELTA: Digital Exploration
of Lute Tablature Agencies (https://www.lmu.de/delta).



@@END: BIO